{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"The Deer Named Lucky Spot: a past life story","html":"<article id='ja11'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Jātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Stories of Past Lives 11 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Sīlavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Ethics </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>1. Lakkhaṇamigajātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Deer Named Lucky Spot: a past life story </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Hoti sīlavataṁ attho, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The virtuous ones prosper, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>paṭisanthāravuttinaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>who live extending protection. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Lakkhaṇaṁ passa āyantaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>See Lucky Spot coming, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>ñātisaṅghapurakkhataṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>surrounded by their family circle; </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Atha passasimaṁ kāḷaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>then see this Black Mark, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>suvihīnaṁva ñātibhī”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>bereft of family. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>Lakkhaṇamigajātakaṁ paṭhamaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
